":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2451667618,"text":"She has also promised that the credit for solving this case will all go to them, so they'll gladly work with us.","nextNodeIds":[220350115]},{"nodeId":220350115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":1143263826,"text":"Leave the thinking and planning to her. Let's just keep up our \"correspondence\" with those Treasure Hoarders.","nextNodeIds":[220350116]},{"nodeId":220350116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":4247725194,"text":"I have also marked the location on your map. Let's get going now.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":220350107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1653078002,"text":"Deceiving our culprit?","nextNodeIds":[220350108]},{"nodeId":220350108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2148645354,"text":"That's right. We must make him continue to believe that our target is the Treasure Hoarders.","nextNodeIds":[220350109]},{"nodeId":220350109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2474464754,"text":"This way, Sango will have more time to complete her plan.","nextNodeIds":[220350110]},{"nodeId":220350110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":3385078610,"text":"*chuckles*... Not that those Treasure Hoarders were up to any good anyway...","nextNodeIds":[220350111]},{"nodeId":220350111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":1820935354,"text":"So we may as well enlist their \"help.\"","nextNodeIds":[220350112]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2203501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1","1","4"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_RANDOM_QUEST_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC"